## Interface: 16001
## Title: Top Ramen Gear
## Notes: /trg opens your class gear window, separated by spec. See what gear in your bags is the best while also getting an easy-to-use hunt list for items in any future dungeons. Not sure how much of an upgrade a dungeon drop is? Now you can compare the level of upgrade to anyone else who has the addon!
## Author: Top Ramen
## Version: 1.17.0
## SavedVariables: TopRamenGearDB, TopRamenLauncherDB
## OptionalDeps: ForeverDungeonJournal, DialogueUI, Auctionator
